>> Animal := Oibseact ùr.
>> Factory := Oibseact ùr.

Animal air: ['ùr'] dèan: {
	>> animal := fhèin ùr.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal air: ['sound:'] dèan: { :s
	leis sound := s.
}.

Animal air: ['sound'] dèan: { <- leis sound.
}.

>> Dog := Oibseact ùr.
>> Cat := Oibseact ùr.

Dog air: ['ùr'] dèan: { <- Animal ùr sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat air: ['ùr'] dèan: { <- Animal ùr sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Às-chur sgrìobh: Dog ùr sound, loidhne-ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: Cat ùr sound, loidhne-ùr.

Factory air: ['mix:and:'] dèan: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal ùr sound: (
		( beast1 sound bho: 0 faid: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound bho: 2 faid: 5 )
	).
}.

Às-chur sgrìobh: (Factory mix: Dog ùr and: Cat ùr) sound, loidhne-ùr.
